; groupdef.dir/arenastaff  (Dare.Arenas)
; Staff decisions on arena requests, and creating arenas directly (?createarena). Included by [mod], [smod] and [sysop] in groupdef.conf;
; never by [arenaowner]/[arenamod], so owners and co-mods cannot approve requests.
cmd_approvearena
cmd_declinearena
cmd_createarena
; the in-game tutorial's counts (?tutorialstats)
cmd_tutorialstats

; Owner/co-mod commands for global staff who own or co-mod an arena. The module never grants
; arena groups to global staff (that would override their global group in the arena), so they
; get the commands here. Each command still checks the arena role in the module's store, so
; staff can use them only in an arena they own (or co-mod, for ?arenaset/?arenaget).
cmd_arenaset
cmd_arenaget
cmd_comod
cmd_arenamap
cmd_putlvz
cmd_rmlvz
cmd_weblogin
cmd_bots

; Never add changesettings here for arena purposes: outside player-owned arenas it edits any
; arena-scope setting, shared defaults included. (?quickfix itself is in groupdef.dir/default:
; Dare.Arenas answers it and checks the arena role.)
